# JSON-RPC endpoint used to read chain data and (for wallets that don't
# self-execute) submit transactions. Sui Foundation fullnodes dropped
# JSON-RPC in July 2026, so a third-party provider is required.
# Known-good options (mainnet, 2026-08):
#   https://mainnet.sui.rpcpool.com/
#   https://sui-rpc.publicnode.com
#   https://sui-mainnet-endpoint.blockvision.org
VITE_SUI_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.sui.rpcpool.com/
